<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Action/Adventure, maybe a touch of horror</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Normal story stuff</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The UIU encounters The Aristocrats (SCP 3288)</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> When Emperor Maximilian I went to Mexico to take the throne, whether knowingly or not, a collection of his &quot;cousins&quot; came with him. While they've managed to fly relatively below the radar until now, a series of disappearances and particularly gruesome recovered bodies along the US/Mexico border have sparked interest.<br />
When a cell phone is recovered with one of the bodies, and holds a picture of what might be a &quot;malformed humanoid&quot; a detachment from the UIU is sent to take over the investigation.<br />
Investigation leads to confrontation with a branch of SCP 3288, with possible implications that by this point they've spread well past the local area.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> An old fashioned &quot;monster battle&quot; adventure story with the Bureau.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Phone posted, so this is especially abbreviated.</p>

